  "description": "Trailing ivy rebuilt after the revision 10 reviews: 13 strands (3-7 m) in loose groups, every leaf its own small card (five-lobed leaf with pale veins, four hues per row) hung from its stalk, turned and tipped out at random on alternate sides; close-set, large and dark near the top, sparser, smaller and yellow-green toward the tapering tips; a dense crown over each group and a ragged line along the edge. Normals bent out from the wall. One mesh (Mesh_ivy), one alpha-mask material; UV.y grows toward the tips for wind.",
